<title>GERMANY: Air France names new Germany cargo director.</title>
<headline>Air France names new Germany cargo director.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Otto Meyer has replaced Helmut Scherret as cargo manager for Germany, Air France said.</p>
<p>Meyer, previously Air France European freight chief in Paris, took over from Scherret, who has retired, at the start of April.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
